OL,3,GNEWSAMan bailed over rape of girl,14,
OL,4,Ain wooded area
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested after a 14-year-old girl
OL,7,Freported she was raped in a wooded area
OL,8,Fnear a roundabout has been released on
OL,9,Fpolice bail.
OL,11,FThe girl reported she was attacked in
OL,12,Fan area of trees off the Wide Lane
OL,13,Froundabout, near Mansbridge Road, in
OL,14,FSwaythling, Southampton, shortly before
OL,15,F15:10 BST on Sunday by a man she did
OL,16,Fnot know.
OL,18,FHampshire police said a 34-year-old
OL,19,Fman, from Southampton, arrested on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of rape had been bailed while
OL,21,Finquiries continue.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
